error[L0512]: cannot pass a borrow of a local value to `pick`
 --> check/local_function_outlived_borrows.rslisp:3:20
  |
1 | (defn fill! ((out (mut (vec (ref str)))) (name string))
  |                                          ------------- this parameter owns its value, which is dropped when the function returns
2 |   (let pick (fn ((s (ref str))) s))
  |                  ------------- `pick` ties this parameter to its result, and the result outlives the borrowed value
3 |   (push! out (pick (as-str name))))
  |                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this borrows a local value
  |
  = help: take the parameter as a `ref`, so that its value outlives the result

